{"id":"efc30a60f20cb4de","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-rp.md","title":"df-rp (RP Complexity Class)","display":"df-rp (RP Complexity Class)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-rp (RP Complexity Class)","label":"28-df-rp","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-rp","RP","RP Complexity Class"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-bpp]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 7.6 and §7.4.1; printed pp.131,133; PDF pp.157,159","source_printed_pages":"131,133","source_pdf_pages":"157,159","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-rp (RP Complexity Class)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-rp"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-rp</span><span>RP</span><span>RP Complexity Class</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 7.6 and §7.4.1; printed pp.131,133; PDF pp.157,159"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"131,133"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"157,159"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M(x;r)\">\\(M(x;r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"073a1a66749fa84e\" href=\"?note=073a1a66749fa84e\" title=\"28-df-bpp\">28-df-bpp</a> 的确定型随机带机约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\">\\(\\mathbf{RP}\\)</span> 为待定义语言类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land(x\\in L\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]\\ge\\tfrac12)\\land(x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]=0)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{RP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land(x\\in L\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]\\ge\\tfrac12)\\land(x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]=0)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本书定义 7.6 采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3\">\\(2/3\\)</span>，本节点采用等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span> 阈值。独立重复并取 OR 可在常数次数内把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1/2\">\\(1/2\\)</span> 升至 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2/3\">\\(2/3\\)</span>，同时保留否实例的零接受概率。</p>\n<p>R7来源勘误：本次查看了 PDF157（印刷131）的页面图像，Definition 7.6 的第二行确实印成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr[(x)=0]=0\">\\(x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr[(x)=0]=0\\)</span>，连机器符号也缺失。该式与同页前述“非成员从不输出1”及随后 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 的解释冲突。本条按该明确上下文采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr[M(x;r)=1]=0\">\\(x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr[M(x;r)=1]=0\\)</span>，记录此处原书误植，不把本地式冒称逐字一致。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-bpp]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-bpp","status":"resolved","id":"073a1a66749fa84e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$；$M(x;r)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)$、$U_j$ 使用 [[28-df-bpp]] 的确定型随机带机约定。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"M(x;r)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists a,b,c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\left[\\forall r\\in\\Sigma^{c(|x|+1)^b}\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_M(x;r)\\le c(|x|+1)^a\\land M(x;r)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\bigr)\\land(x\\in L\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]\\ge\\tfrac12)\\land(x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr_{r\\leftarrow U_{c(|x|+1)^b}}[M(x;r)=1]=0)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"2/3","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false},{"tex":"1/2","display":false},{"tex":"2/3","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr[(x)=0]=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{RP}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\notin L\\Rightarrow\\Pr[M(x;r)=1]=0","display":false}],"bytes":1710,"backlinks":[{"id":"2bf2934e8ac23510","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\overline L=\\Sigma^*\\setminus L$；$\\mathbf{RP}$ 见 [[28-df-rp]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"概率机器与类：[[28-df-probabilistic-tm]]、[[28-df-bpp]]、[[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]、[[28-df-zpp]]、[[28-df-pp]]。"},{"id":"d94d9ef3ea3cdf77","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{RP}$ 见 [[28-df-rp]]，$\\mathbf{NP}$ 见 [[28-df-np]]。"},{"id":"b4f292ee2a50229e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{ZPP}$ 为 [[28-df-zpp]] 的零错误期望时间类，$\\mathbf{RP}$、$\\mathbf{coRP}$ 分别见 [[28-df-rp]]、[[28-df-co-rp]]。"}],"outgoing":["073a1a66749fa84e"]}